                "text": "Republicans\u2019 shutdown is putting America\u2019s public health at risk:\n\n\ud83d\udea8@CDCgov has furloughed 64% of its staff  \n\ud83d\udea8@NIH has furloughed 75%  \n\ud83d\udea8@HHSgov has furloughed 41%\n\n...and that is not even counting all those laid off by the Trump admin.\n\nHardworking Americans shouldn\u2019t have to suffer while extreme Washington Republicans play politics with our health and safety.",
