                "text": "It was a pleasure to meet with the general leadership of Inova\u2019s Juniper Program this week in Prince William County.\n\nWe discussed challenges posed by recent Republican health care cuts and the upcoming opening of their new Health Center in Woodbridge, which will expand access to care across the region.",
