                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined the House Veterans Affairs Committee and @RepJeffries today for a roundtable on veterans\u2019 benefits, where I highlighted the unbearable wait times and staffing crisis at the Fredericksburg Health Care Center in my district.\n\nOur veterans deserve timely, high-quality care \u2014 and this facility is falling short. @SecVetAffairs, this must change.",
