                "text": "I\u2019ve sent two letters to @SecVetAffairs demanding answers about ongoing care delays at the Fredericksburg VA Health Care Center \u2014 and still haven\u2019t received a response.\n\nOur veterans shouldn\u2019t wait weeks or months for the care they\u2019ve earned. They deserve better.",
